Alibaba Java Standards: Songshan Edition

This repository contains an English synthesis and adaptations of the Java
Development Manual, Songshan edition, version 1.7.0, released 2020-08-03,
by Alibaba Group technical teams and community contributors.

Original project: https://github.com/alibaba/p3c
Original English guidelines: https://alibaba.github.io/Alibaba-Java-Coding-Guidelines

The source manual's version history records adoption of the Apache License 2.0
in version 1.3.1. The official P3C project also declares Apache 2.0 licensing.

Changes in this adaptation: English instructional prose, condensed rules,
chapter/topic navigation, decision tables, reconstructed application examples,
and labeled technical clarifications. The source PDF and its artwork are not
included. This repository is an independent adaptation, not an official new
edition or an endorsement by the source contributors.

